    "text": "&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to :",
